1" style=3D"color:transparent" src=3D"https://bytebytego.com/images/courses=
/coding-patterns/bit-manipulation/hamming-weights-of-integers/image-18-01-4=
-55GW7SBE.svg?dpl=3Ddpl_CEjisbLnWxFQGUTRjiHGoKY1oV5c"></div></figure>
</li>
<li>
<p>If the LSB of <code>x</code> is 1, the difference in the number of bits =
between <code>x</code> and <code>x &gt;&gt; 1</code> is 1:</p>
<figure class=3D"py-1"><div style=3D"display:flex;justify-content:center"><=
img alt=3D"Image represents a diagram illustrating a bit manipulation opera=
